"P973556460" "I'm sorry Foreshadow. <em>I thought I could do this on my own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1762988471" "I'm so sorry. I hope you aren't badly hurt."

